# Docs and changelog

## CHANGELOG.md
- When adding or changing **user-facing or implemented behaviour**, add an entry to `CHANGELOG.md` under the appropriate heading (Added / Changed / Fixed).

## implementation-status.md
- When implementing something that appears in the design or implementation-status list, update `Docs/implementation-status.md` (e.g. mark items implemented, adjust priority list, or add a short note).
